Q-PLAN INTERNATIONAL (www.qplan-intl.gr) is an innovation and management consulting company that possesses valuable know-how and expertise in the design, management and co-ordination of European policy studies, research projects and support actions in several scientific fields. On top of these, the company provides hands-on support to both public and private sector clients in the design and implementation of their innovation and research strategies as well as in the implementation of their international networking and knowledge transfer activities. Last but not least, Q-PLAN is currently the market leader at national level in the development and implementation of Management Systems with more than 700 certified private and public-sector clients from all business sectors.
Since 2005, the company has led or participated in more than 50 research and policy studies and H2020/FP7/FP6 projects, mainly as consortium leader (coordinator). In the framework of these studies and projects, Q-PLAN has gained considerable expertise, amongst others, in the: 
(i) design, elaboration and analysis of evaluation and impact assessment of research and innovation programmes and projects on regional, national and European level; 
(ii) skills and their matching to labour market needs;
(iii) design, measurement and interpretation of tailored KPIs;
(iv) identification of future trajectories (foresight);
(v) organisation and conduct of co-creation workshops; 
(vi) engagement of stakeholders and tailored-made raising awareness events and activities; and 
(vi) translation of research findings into actionable knowledge for actors, stakeholders and policy-makers on different levels. 

Areas of expertise include: research and innovation policy on EU / national / regional levels, smart cities, circular economy, bioeconomy, (Smart) transport, environment, (digital) social innovation, (digital) social economy, Responsible Research and Innovation.

VT Solutions & Consulting is an innovation company focused on main knowledge pillars: Big Data and Analytics, Machine Learning and Deep Learning, DevOps, Cloud, Microservice architecture, Data Integration and Data Warehouse, Blockchain. 
Our Research and Innovation group is specialized in Machine Learning application in eHealth, Retail, Energy business sector and is starting artificial intelligence initiatives in aerospace sector with collaboration with a Digital Manufacturing client. Machine Learning application, Big Data and DevOps expertise let VT Solutions to lead the topic of Machine Learning Ops stream creating the next step in machine learning applications: Model industrialization.

